And approach the place where it lands

00:01:12.450 --> 00:01:17.120
Shiawase na utatane no ato wa

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:17.120
After a pleasant nap

00:01:17.490 --> 00:01:21.540
Yappa yappa akubi de namida nijimu

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:21.530
Sure enough, sure enough,
my eyes tear when I yawn

00:01:21.530 --> 00:01:22.700
Good morning

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:22.710
Ohayou

00:01:22.700 --> 00:01:23.870
Let's play!

00:01:22.710 --> 00:01:23.880
Asobo!

00:01:23.870 --> 00:01:26.570
Let's have a serious bread-eating race

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:26.550
Honki de pangui kyousou

00:01:26.550 --> 00:01:27.710
Wasshoi! Washoshoi!

00:01:26.570 --> 00:01:27.710
Wasshoi! Washoshoi!

00:01:27.710 --> 00:01:30.240
Who, who, who, who, who is it?

00:01:27.710 --> 00:01:30.220
Dare dare dare dare dare da

00:01:30.220 --> 00:01:33.590
Hara hara hara hara harapeko-san

00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:33.580
Hungry, hungry, hungry,
hungry, hungry person

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:37.980
Girls live off snacks

00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:37.970
Onna no ko okashi ga shushoku da

00:01:37.970 --> 00:01:39.730
Wasshoi! Washoshoi!
Koro koro koro korogatte

00:01:37.980 --> 00:01:39.750
Wasshoi! Washoshoi!
Rolling, rolling, rolling, golfing around

00:01:39.730 --> 00:01:40.560
Koro koro koro korogatte

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:40.550
Rolling, rolling, rolling, golfing around

00:01:40.550 --> 00:01:43.890
Lazing, lazing, lazing, lazing, lazing about

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:43.900
Nobi nobi nobi nobi nonbirishite

00:01:43.890 --> 00:01:47.790
Let's look up at the sun

00:01:43.900 --> 00:01:47.770
Sora o miyou ohisama ni

00:01:47.770 --> 00:01:51.070
Wasshoi desu wasshoi desu

00:01:47.790 --> 00:01:51.060
Wasshoi! Wasshoi!

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:53.600
In a dream, in a dream with everyone
Wasshoi! Wasshoi!

00:01:51.070 --> 00:01:53.610
Yume de yume de minna to
Wasshoi desu wasshoi desu

00:01:53.600 --> 00:01:56.170
I had the same conversation

00:01:53.610 --> 00:01:56.160
Onnaji kaiwa shiteta yo

00:01:56.160 --> 00:02:00.080
Hatena de wasshoi 365

00:01:56.170 --> 00:02:00.070
Question mark and washoi 365

00:02:00.070 --> 00:02:01.870
Wasshoi! Washoshoi!

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:01.870
Wasshoi! Washoshoi!

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:10.500
All night again?

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:12.360
I just realized I slept on my desk.

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:15.310
You're gonna get a summer cold.

00:02:15.310 --> 00:02:17.510
Yeah. I'll be careful.

00:02:17.510 --> 00:02:20.940
I had to think of a new theme by today.

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:23.840
I'm meeting with my editor at 1 PM.

00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:24.790
Will it be okay?

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:27.290
Yeah. I just decided on it.

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:28.540
Sae!

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:30.970
Still haven't decided on a project yet?

00:02:30.970 --> 00:02:31.630
Miyako.

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:32.630
Sae.

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:34.300
Good morning.

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:35.290
Morning.

00:02:35.290 --> 00:02:39.330
She has a meeting with her editor today.

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:41.890
Good luck.

00:02:42.670 --> 00:02:43.890
Thanks.

00:02:54.890 --> 00:02:57.370
Hello? Mom? What is it?

00:03:00.070 --> 00:03:02.250
Chika wants to enroll in summer school?

00:03:02.250 --> 00:03:05.610
If she says she wants to go, let her go.

00:03:08.570 --> 00:03:12.860
No way. We never talk about that.

00:03:12.860 --> 00:03:15.350
Alright, I'll call her.

00:03:15.350 --> 00:03:17.550
I said I'll call her.

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:18.920
Okay, okay.

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:22.760
Goodbye.

00:03:25.550 --> 00:03:29.180
Is she really that eager to
take summer school?

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:37.440
You forgot to water the morning
glories, didn't you?

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:39.400
No, I didn't!

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:41.340
I just didn't wake up!

00:03:41.340 --> 00:03:45.640
I told you to water them every day
during summer vacation!

00:03:45.640 --> 00:03:49.170
It's because my parents won't wake me up!

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:00.850
I lasted three days this time.

00:04:06.550 --> 00:04:08.550
Thank you very much.

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:13.690
Looks like some bizarre karma brought us together this summer vacation.

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:15.060
Natsume!

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:18.650
Do you think being here will
let you study better?

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:19.900
It's none of your business!

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:23.360
It seems that you aren't
going to school either.

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:25.470
You're neglecting your art projects.

00:04:25.470 --> 00:04:26.660
Natsume!

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:29.990
Hey, they're calling you. Get going.

00:04:29.990 --> 00:04:32.180
Well, you can do whatever
you want with your time.

00:04:32.180 --> 00:04:35.650
If you aren't going to enjoy your summer vacation, then the least you can do is give it to me!

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:37.630
I would've enjoyed it even
if you didn't tell me to!

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:40.710
Jeez.

00:04:42.390 --> 00:04:44.880
She didn't see it, right?

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:46.320
Want to come to my place?

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:47.260
Sounds great.

00:04:47.810 --> 00:04:48.640
Welcome.

00:04:49.410 --> 00:04:52.600
Sae, thanks for the hard work.

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:54.270
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:04:55.050 --> 00:04:57.860
Naoi, thanks for the hard work.

00:04:57.860 --> 00:05:00.360
Iced coffee, two of them, please.

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:01.480
Is that okay?

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:02.150
Sure.

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:04.780
Well, can you show it to me?

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:06.660
Please.

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:11.610
A love story, is it?

00:05:11.610 --> 00:05:12.420
Understood.

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:14.640
Shall we go with this, then?

00:05:16.320 --> 00:05:18.990
I wanted to try writing one.

00:05:18.990 --> 00:05:22.430
Expressing emotion is very important when it comes to love.

00:05:22.430 --> 00:05:25.510
It would be hard to write
about without experience.

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:27.010
Experience?

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:30.770
I'll be waiting for the story
only you can write.

00:05:31.480 --> 00:05:34.310
Thank you very much. I'll do my best.

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:42.480
I'm back.

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:45.910
Sae, welcome home.

00:05:45.910 --> 00:05:46.860
Herbs?

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:47.760
Yes.

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:51.130
Somehow bugs started eating them.

00:05:51.130 --> 00:05:53.010
I have to do something.

00:05:53.010 --> 00:05:53.810
Bugs...

00:05:54.460 --> 00:05:57.320
How did the meeting go?

00:05:57.320 --> 00:06:00.130
She approved my story, so it's no problem.

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:02.130
Really? That's good.

00:06:03.310 --> 00:06:05.980
That's not the problem, though.

00:06:05.980 --> 00:06:07.970
Hmm? What happened?

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:11.180
My sister decided to go to summer school.

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:14.860
Chika's getting ready to
take entrance exams.

00:06:14.860 --> 00:06:19.690
I haven't enrolled in any cram school yet, so my parents are worried.

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:22.090
They want me to encourage her, somehow.

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:24.570
Summer's the turning point for entrance exams.

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:27.450
It would be nice not
to feel the pressure.

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:28.860
That's true.

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:33.110
Wouldn't Chika be happy
if you called her?

00:06:33.110 --> 00:06:36.540
I don't really know
what to tell her.

00:06:38.720 --> 00:06:40.480
I bought ice cream.

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:41.250
Let's eat.

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:44.290
Pardon us!

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:45.430
Sure!

00:06:45.430 --> 00:06:46.300
Come in.

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:52.370
Ice cream! Ice cream! Ice cream!

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:49.750
Okay, okay.

00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:52.370
Here.

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:53.030
Here.

00:06:53.030 --> 00:06:54.670
Thank you.

00:06:54.670 --> 00:06:55.350
Here.

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:56.190
Thanks.

00:06:57.860 --> 00:06:59.690
Thanks for the food!

00:07:01.360 --> 00:07:03.190
Thanks for the food!

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:06.700
Thanks for the food!

00:07:08.370 --> 00:07:10.200
Let's eat!

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:17.040
So nice!

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:21.540
This must be my reward for
enduring today's heat.

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:27.220
There's so many projects in July, I want to finally have fun next month.

00:07:27.220 --> 00:07:28.620
Me too.

00:07:28.620 --> 00:07:29.610
What about you, Sae?

00:07:29.610 --> 00:07:32.740
I'd like to plan out some
more novel ideas.

00:07:32.740 --> 00:07:35.970
Also, the books I've been wanting to read have been piling up. I want to get through those.

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:37.400
That sounds tough.

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:39.890
When is everyone
going back home?

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:43.200
I haven't decided yet.

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:45.610
Guess the projects are more
important right now.

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:49.780
Does anyone have a
person they like?

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:51.410
Sae?

00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:52.150
So sudden.

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:53.280
What's wrong?

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:56.280
Well, it's for my next story.

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:58.860
Just wanted to research
everyone's experience.

00:07:58.860 --> 00:08:00.540
Yunocchi, do you like someone?

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:07.630
Dad and Nyanta.

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:09.340
Nyanta?

00:08:10.060 --> 00:08:12.650
Is that no good?
Wait a minute.

00:08:12.650 --> 00:08:14.880
I like my dad too.

00:08:14.880 --> 00:08:18.090
Right?

00:08:18.090 --> 00:08:19.980
I guess I don't really know.

00:08:19.980 --> 00:08:26.980
Someone you like so much you could spend hours thinking about them in a single day.

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:33.040
Miya's mostly been thinking
about her dried food today.

00:08:33.040 --> 00:08:33.950
Hey, hey.

00:08:35.270 --> 00:08:37.760
That isn't much
research at all.

00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:39.420
What about you, Sae?

00:08:39.420 --> 00:08:42.870
Well, I have so much experience...

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:45.750
It's hard to compare to
normal highschoolers.

00:08:47.480 --> 00:08:49.950
There's no beating Sae.

00:08:49.950 --> 00:08:51.840
Sae is so mature.

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:53.670
I guess...

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:55.600
Good night.

00:08:55.600 --> 00:08:57.420
Good night.

00:09:00.300 --> 00:09:01.840
Good night.

00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:03.110
Good night.

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:06.870
Are you staying up
late tonight again?

00:09:06.870 --> 00:09:09.850
Yeah. I want to get going now since it's been approved.

00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:13.110
Bye.

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:15.590
Did you call Chika yet?

00:09:16.830 --> 00:09:22.780
She's probably feeling helpless
and waiting for your call.

00:09:22.780 --> 00:09:24.240
Alright.

00:09:26.820 --> 00:09:29.380
Chika, good luck with
summer school.

00:09:30.820 --> 00:09:34.590
Don't overdo it, now.

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:36.130
Ah, whatever!

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:41.590
Hello? Onee-chan?

00:09:41.590 --> 00:09:42.400
Yeah.

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:44.520
What's up? This is so rare.

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:47.780
Well, you're going to
summer school, right?

00:09:47.780 --> 00:09:49.790
Did you hear that from Mom?

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:53.450
Yeah, I'm doing it with some friends since entrance exams are coming up.

00:09:53.450 --> 00:09:55.450
Really?

00:09:55.450 --> 00:09:59.790
Your grades won't improve quickly if you just throw yourself into studying.

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:03.650
It's better to study
consistently every day.

00:10:03.650 --> 00:10:08.630
Studying is important, but at the same time, you don't want to overextend yourself.

00:10:11.120 --> 00:10:16.220
I'll be heading back for Obon, so if there's anything you don't know, just ask me.

00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:18.910
Chika?

00:10:20.440 --> 00:10:22.070
Chika?

00:10:22.070 --> 00:10:27.690
Onee-chan, you're saying whatever you're trying to say because you're worried about me.

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:29.340
Who would be worried about you?

00:10:29.340 --> 00:10:32.140
Huh? Didn't you call because
you were worried?

00:10:32.140 --> 00:10:33.010
That ain't it.

00:10:33.010 --> 00:10:35.740
Then why?

00:10:35.740 --> 00:10:38.850
Because Mom was telling me
to come home for Obon.

00:10:38.850 --> 00:10:40.480
No way. You said it yourself.

00:10:40.480 --> 00:10:41.850
Fine.

00:10:41.850 --> 00:10:45.560
You better clean up all the
junk you left in my room.

00:10:45.560 --> 00:10:47.580
I would've cleaned it even if you didn't tell me to.

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:49.660
Okay, that's it then.

00:10:49.660 --> 00:10:51.370
Why don't you be more honest?

00:10:51.370 --> 00:10:54.510
That's why you still don't have a boyfriend even though you're in high school.

00:10:54.510 --> 00:10:56.480
High school has nothing
to do with that!

00:10:56.480 --> 00:10:58.820
This must be one lonely
summer vacation for you.

00:10:58.820 --> 00:11:02.950
I have summer school, so sorry if I can't come over and keep you busy.

00:11:02.950 --> 00:11:05.000
You wanted to
come here?

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:07.460
You told me it was fine!

00:11:07.460 --> 00:11:09.720
I changed my mind.
Don't come over.

00:11:09.720 --> 00:11:13.550
I'm busy having dates every day, so I don't have time to be worrying about you.

00:11:13.550 --> 00:11:14.660
That's totally a l-

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:20.250
It ended in a fight.

00:11:20.980 --> 00:11:22.930
I'm tired.

00:11:22.930 --> 00:11:25.760
I spent all day thinking about Chika.

00:11:26.810 --> 00:11:29.520
I didn't even get to say "good luck" to her.

00:11:39.770 --> 00:11:45.010
Someone you like so much you could spend hours thinking about them in a single day.

00:11:50.960 --> 00:11:53.400
Guess it was Chika today...

00:12:00.140 --> 00:12:01.400
Phew.

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:04.780
Guess I'll keep working a bit more.

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:07.780
A message from Hiro.

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:12.490
Roger that.

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:26.730
Work! Back to work!

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:55.670
Good morning.

00:12:55.670 --> 00:12:59.250
Today is super fun
cooking training!

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:01.340
Aren't you and Yuno sketching today?

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:05.380
And making cream puffs
fits Hiro perfectly.

00:13:06.120 --> 00:13:07.090
Why is that?

00:13:07.090 --> 00:13:10.350
Your hairbuns look
just like cream puffs.

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:13.640
Miya, you're drooling.

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:14.840
Oh my.

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:20.750
Today, we're making cream puffs.

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:24.990
Put on your apron and handkerchief, wash your hands, then pick up your ingredients.

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:27.260
Here's an apron, Sae.

00:13:27.260 --> 00:13:29.240
Thanks, you saved me.

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:30.720
Sorry for borrowing this.

00:13:30.720 --> 00:13:32.260
No problem.

00:13:34.390 --> 00:13:35.290
Sae!

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:36.290
So cute!

00:13:36.290 --> 00:13:38.290
Ah, shut up.

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:44.940
Argh, now that I know they're making cream puffs, my heart's no longer set on sketching.

00:13:44.940 --> 00:13:46.800
I hope they share
them with us later.

00:13:48.670 --> 00:13:50.360
Spin! Hello, everyone.

00:13:50.360 --> 00:13:52.090
Good morning!

00:13:52.530 --> 00:13:59.630
All those girls in the hallway were so cute in their aprons, they inspired me to wear one too!

00:13:59.630 --> 00:14:03.820
Ah, I have a swimsuit
underneath, so don't worry.

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:05.070
We're worried...

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:08.350
It's pretty cold in here to be
wearing only a swimsuit.

00:14:08.350 --> 00:14:11.780
Teacher doesn't have
her priorities straight.

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:16.950
Hiro, you're so
skilled at cooking.

00:14:16.950 --> 00:14:19.300
Really? Thank you.

00:14:19.300 --> 00:14:20.250
Hiro!

00:14:20.730 --> 00:14:22.890
Is this enough eggs?

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:24.630
Yup. Perfect.

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:27.920
If you put any more
in, it won't rise.

00:14:31.940 --> 00:14:33.420
Hiro, what are you doing?

00:14:33.420 --> 00:14:36.690
I thought I'd clean
some utensils now.

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:41.380
Must be nice, Sae.

00:14:41.380 --> 00:14:44.250
You must be pretty
bad at cooking.

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:48.890
Not bad, but not great either.

00:14:48.890 --> 00:14:50.960
How is that comforting?

00:14:50.960 --> 00:14:52.320
Hiro!

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:54.800
Can you whip this for me?

00:14:54.800 --> 00:14:56.110
Sure. I'll do it.

00:14:59.030 --> 00:15:02.040
This is really working
my upper arm.

00:15:02.550 --> 00:15:06.280
Hiro, how did whipping
cream turn into this?

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:08.920
I'm sorry!

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:15.500
Hmm, you're more daring
with the blacks in this one.

00:15:15.500 --> 00:15:17.270
Thank you very much.

00:15:17.270 --> 00:15:20.850
Are there other parts that
I could've improved on?

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:22.970
Oh my.

00:15:22.970 --> 00:15:27.220
I've never heard such a
proactive statement before.

00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:29.310
She is growing as an...

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:33.700
Yuno, are you possibly
becoming more mature?

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:36.490
And before me, at that...

00:15:40.380 --> 00:15:42.460
We're cooking them
in the oven, right?

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:44.120
Yeah. It's okay.

00:15:46.950 --> 00:15:48.430
Are they puffy yet?

00:15:48.430 --> 00:15:50.950
It doesn't happen that fast.

00:15:52.980 --> 00:15:55.530
I figured they'd be
done by now.

00:15:55.530 --> 00:15:59.440
They'll grow if you aren't impatient.

00:15:59.440 --> 00:16:03.490
That's what I thought
too, but mine are...

00:16:03.490 --> 00:16:04.600
What are we talking about?

00:16:05.210 --> 00:16:06.220
We're done!

00:16:06.220 --> 00:16:07.980
Done!

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:09.980
Teacher, here's group six.

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:11.920
Okay, group six.

00:16:11.920 --> 00:16:13.570
Thanks for the food.

00:16:16.110 --> 00:16:19.320
The area between pastry
and cream is not too big.

00:16:19.320 --> 00:16:24.370
And the depth of the custard and whipped cream strikes a marvelous balance.

00:16:24.860 --> 00:16:28.430
And then the bitter sweetness
of the strawberry spreads...

00:16:30.420 --> 00:16:33.580
Wait! I didn't tell you to put in strawberries!

00:16:33.580 --> 00:16:35.090
I'm sorry...

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:39.690
Well, please enjoy.

00:16:39.690 --> 00:16:41.440
They look great!

00:16:41.440 --> 00:16:43.560
Thanks for th... Yummy!

00:16:43.560 --> 00:16:44.870
Miyako.

00:16:44.870 --> 00:16:46.060
Thanks for the food.

00:16:51.470 --> 00:16:53.440
So good, the sweetness is just right!

00:16:53.440 --> 00:16:56.460
Oh, I was trying to hold
back on the sweetness.

00:16:56.460 --> 00:17:01.080
I guess I've become more mature, right?

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:02.790
Thanks for the food.

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:05.460
Such happiness.

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:08.020
Miyako, you spilled some.

00:17:08.020 --> 00:17:09.580
The bell.

00:17:09.580 --> 00:17:10.960
Well, see you after school.

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:14.170
Will you show me how to
make them next time?

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:17.110
Sure. Leave it to me.

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:19.300
Sae too, right?

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:20.730
I'm in your care.

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:26.850
There it is.

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:47.500
Oh?

00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:57.590
That'll be seven hundred yen.

00:17:57.590 --> 00:17:59.020
Would you like a bag for this?

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:02.010
Put it in!

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:04.020
Thank you very much!

00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:07.770
The setting sun is so beautiful.

00:18:08.490 --> 00:18:09.730
Sae?

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:11.730
Yeah, come in.

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:18.200
I ran into Natsume at
the bookstore earlier.

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:20.660
She bought an issue of Kirara Monthly.

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:21.320
Natsume did?

00:18:21.320 --> 00:18:23.200
I wonder what she reads.

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:27.460
Who knows? This month's issue
has a lot of popular series.

00:18:28.360 --> 00:18:29.750
Really?

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:32.400
Maybe she's a Tachibana Aya fan.

00:18:32.400 --> 00:18:33.470
No way.

00:18:35.740 --> 00:18:39.260
Get a smaller face by
blowing balloons.

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:41.950
It sounds painful on the lymphs.

00:18:41.950 --> 00:18:44.250
Aromatherapy is also popular.

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:48.210
It says you can suppress your appetite with the scent of grapefruit.

00:18:48.210 --> 00:18:50.790
Hey, this talks about
a chocolate diet!

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:52.200
Prevents your metabolism
from slowing down.

00:18:52.200 --> 00:18:55.190
Lowers cholesterol.

00:18:55.190 --> 00:18:58.270
Prevents overeating when
eaten before a meal.

00:18:58.270 --> 00:19:00.540
What a wonderful
thing they made!

00:19:00.540 --> 00:19:03.450
This is definitely different from those other things I've tried so far!

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:08.380
Pardon us!

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:12.500
We bought snacks to thank
you for the cream puffs.

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:14.090
I picked them out.

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:16.710
Thank you. What did you buy?

00:19:16.710 --> 00:19:19.510
Special sale chocolate!

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:21.220
Chocolate!

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:22.590
You are correct.

00:19:25.360 --> 00:19:26.750
Apron over a swimsuit?

00:19:26.750 --> 00:19:30.280
I do not understand
this Yoshinoya-sensei.

00:19:30.280 --> 00:19:31.850
Why does she always...

00:19:31.850 --> 00:19:34.860
Maybe I am the
one being weird.

00:19:34.860 --> 00:19:37.370
I don't think that's it.

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:42.950
I knew it was hopeless.

00:19:43.830 --> 00:19:46.800
Look. The chocolate really works.

00:19:46.800 --> 00:19:49.060
That's incredible, even
though it's candy.

00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:52.410
Wow, this person lost 10
kilograms in a month.

00:19:52.410 --> 00:19:53.370
Where?

00:19:53.370 --> 00:19:55.020
That's with diet jelly.

00:19:55.020 --> 00:19:56.880
I don't believe in jelly anymore.

00:19:56.880 --> 00:19:58.980
It didn't work at all.

00:19:58.980 --> 00:20:01.090
Looks like Sae fell asleep.

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:02.330
Oh my.

00:20:02.330 --> 00:20:05.370
She must be tired.

00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:07.510
Yunocchi, this person...

00:20:14.850 --> 00:20:16.730
Don't want that in your face.

00:20:22.120 --> 00:20:23.030
The stars are shining.

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:26.200
The sky cleared up, so
they're easier to see.

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:30.290
Taurus, Leo, Orion.

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:32.550
Miya, you know your constellations.

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:38.420
It was a short time, but I had
to rely on Polaris to navigate.

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:42.520
Did I hear that wrong?

00:20:43.970 --> 00:20:46.730
If I get a good look at
it, my breath is white.

00:20:46.730 --> 00:20:48.950
Winter's coming soon.

00:20:48.950 --> 00:20:51.560
Sae. If we leave her like
that, she might get a cold.

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:56.990
I'll check on her later and make
sure she sleeps in bed.

00:20:56.990 --> 00:20:58.200
Miya!

00:20:58.200 --> 00:21:00.400
Be careful, a car might come through.

00:21:00.400 --> 00:21:01.320
Okay!

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:03.820
Hiro, you act like Sae's wife.

00:21:04.740 --> 00:21:07.690
And you're like a mother to us.

00:21:07.690 --> 00:21:08.870
Mother...

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:10.650
Yo, well-rounded!

00:21:10.650 --> 00:21:12.400
I mean,<i> courageous mother.</i>

00:21:12.400 --> 00:21:13.440
Miya!

00:21:15.260 --> 00:21:19.040
Hiro is so kind and generous.

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:22.990
Whenever I'm near you, I
feel so warm inside.

00:21:22.990 --> 00:21:26.080
Yeah, when I'm near her I start getting hot.

00:21:26.080 --> 00:21:27.220
Miya!

00:21:27.810 --> 00:21:29.240
Geez!

00:21:29.780 --> 00:21:31.810
Yuno, thank you.

00:21:34.480 --> 00:21:36.230
Good night.

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:38.780
Good night.

00:21:44.750 --> 00:21:47.430
Ah, so chubby.

00:21:47.430 --> 00:21:50.110
Even though I do
my hip rotations.

00:21:50.110 --> 00:21:52.760
Maybe I'll try rubbing it with salt.

00:21:58.860 --> 00:22:01.630
I wonder if Sae's awake yet.

00:22:04.080 --> 00:22:06.850
Maybe I'll bring her some
hot ginger to drink.

00:22:19.440 --> 00:22:25.650
An unknown world stretched out

00:22:19.440 --> 00:22:25.650
Dare mo shiranai sekai ga hirogatte

00:22:25.650 --> 00:22:31.410
Connecting, endless connecting threads

00:22:25.650 --> 00:22:31.410
Tsunagaru dokomademo tsutzuru ito

00:22:32.030 --> 00:22:38.460
An upside down world is pretty fun

00:22:32.030 --> 00:22:38.460
Sakasama no sekai igai to tanoshiin da yo

00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:44.250
Connecting, never-ending threads

00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:44.250
Tsunagaru dokomademo tsutzuku ito

00:22:44.630 --> 00:22:50.300
You are smiling somewhere today

00:22:44.630 --> 00:22:50.300
Dokoka de kyou mo kimi ga waratteru

00:22:50.840 --> 00:22:55.890
I will run all night until the day we meet again

00:22:50.840 --> 00:22:55.890
Mata deaeru hi made zutto hashiru yo

00:22:55.890 --> 00:22:57.480
Run all night

00:22:55.890 --> 00:22:57.480
Hashiru yo

00:22:57.480 --> 00:23:00.560
The record of a resounding shooting star

00:22:57.480 --> 00:23:00.560
Takanatte ryuusei rekoodo

00:23:00.560 --> 00:23:03.900
Your singing voice

00:23:00.560 --> 00:23:03.900
Kimi no utagoe ga

00:23:03.900 --> 00:23:06.980
Touches my heart

00:23:03.900 --> 00:23:06.980
Boku no mune o utsu yo

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:10.240
A sky full of shooting stars

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:10.240
Nagareboshi no sora

00:23:10.240 --> 00:23:13.370
The record of a shining shooting star

00:23:10.240 --> 00:23:13.370
Mabushii ryuusei rekoodo

00:23:13.370 --> 00:23:16.580
Your whispering voice

00:23:13.370 --> 00:23:16.580
Sasayaku sono koe ga

00:23:16.580 --> 00:23:20.040
Leads me through space

00:23:16.580 --> 00:23:20.000
Boku o uchuu michibiku

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:22.880
Nagareboshi no uta

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:22.880
A song about shooting stars

00:23:22.880 --> 00:23:26.420
I can't hear them

00:23:22.880 --> 00:23:26.420
Kikoenai

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:30.380
I can't reach them

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:30.380
Todokanai

00:23:30.380 --> 00:23:34.930
The footsteps I'm looking for

00:23:30.380 --> 00:23:34.930
Sagasu ashioto o

00:23:40.500 --> 00:23:46.250
Paper Balloon, Sakura, Clamming, April Fool, Deep Sleep, Skylark, Spring Moon, Cat Love, Sprouting Ash...

00:23:46.250 --> 00:23:48.490
What is it this time? Story titles?

00:23:48.490 --> 00:23:50.740
Nope. Seasonal words to use in haikus.

00:23:50.740 --> 00:23:52.550
What about dandelion and violet?

00:23:52.550 --> 00:23:53.890
Sakura-mochi! Nightengale-mochi!

00:23:53.890 --> 00:23:57.000
There's kanji that connects to spring too. Like spanish mackerel or camellia.

00:23:57.000 --> 00:23:58.810
Wow, everyone's got good ideas.

00:23:58.810 --> 00:23:59.550
Spring rolls?

00:23:59.550 --> 00:24:01.350
Too bad! That seems off.

00:24:01.350 --> 00:24:05.720
Next time, April 7, School Entrance Ceremony and Welcoming Party.

00:24:05.720 --> 00:24:09.890
We'll be waiting at Hidamari Apartments. Please come and see us.
